#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:4
msgid "Lookup CD or Ripper Log"
msgstr "查找 CD 或 Ripper 日志"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:6
msgid "The steps to follow to :index:`lookup a CD <lookup; cd, lookup; ripper log>` are:"
msgstr "要 :index:`查找 CD <lookup; cd, lookup; ripper log>` 的步骤是："

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:9
msgid "Step 1"
msgstr "步骤 1"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:11
msgid "Make sure the CD is inserted in the drive, and select :menuselection:`\"Tools --> Lookup CD... --> (drive to use)\"`. The CD TOC will be calculated and sent to MusicBrainz. Alternately, you can use a :ref:`supported ripper log file <faq_supported_rippers>` to lookup the CD using the :menuselection:`\"Tools --> Lookup CD --> From CD ripper log file...\"` command. This will open a file browser dialog to allow you to select the log file to process. Either method will query the MusicBrainz database and display a list of matching releases."
msgstr ""
"确保 CD 已插入驱动器，并选择 :menuselection:`\"Tools --> Lookup CD... --> (要"
"使用的驱动器)\"`。将计算 CD TOC 并发送到 MusicBrainz。或者，您可以使用 "
":ref:`supported ripper log file <faq_supported_rippers>` 通过 "
":menuselection:`\"Tools --> Lookup CD --> From CD ripper log file...\"` 命令"
"查找 CD。这将打开一个文件浏览器对话框，允许您选择要处理的日志文件。任何方法都"
"将查询 MusicBrainz 数据库并显示匹配的发行品列表。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:21
msgid "Step 2"
msgstr "步骤 2"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:23
msgid "Select the correct release from the list and click on the :guilabel:`Load into Picard` button. This will load the information for the release into Picard."
msgstr ""
"从列表中选择正确的发行品并单击 :guilabel:`Load into Picard` 按钮。这将将发行"
"品的信息加载到 Picard 中。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:25
msgid "A music symbol in front of a track number in the right-hand pane indicates that there has been no file assigned to the track."
msgstr "在右侧窗格中的音轨号前有一个音乐符号，表示该音轨没有分配文件。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:35
msgid "Step 3"
msgstr "步骤 3"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:37
msgid "If there are no matches or none of the matches are correct, use the :guilabel:`Submit disc ID` option to locate the correct release. Enter the release title or artist and initiate the search. You will be provided with a list of the releases that match your search criterion and have the same number of tracks as your CD TOC."
msgstr ""
"如果没有匹配项或没有正确的匹配项，请使用 :guilabel:`Submit disc ID` 选项来定"
"位正确的发行品。输入发行品标题或艺术家名称并启动搜索。您将获得一个符合您的搜"
"索标准且音轨数量与您的 CD TOC 相同的发行品列表。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:50
msgid "Step 4"
msgstr "步骤 4"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:52
msgid "Use the green arrow |lookup_tagger| to load the information for a release into Picard. In addition, you can select the release and attach the CD TOC."
msgstr ""
"使用绿色箭头 |lookup_tagger| 将发行品信息加载到 Picard 中。此外，您可以选择发"
"行品并附加 CD TOC。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:46
msgid "lookup_tagger"
msgstr ""

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:63
msgid "If you looked up by artist, and made your selection by clicking on the artist's name in the list rather than selecting the artist using the radio button next to the artist's name, you will not be allowed to attach the disc id to a release."
msgstr ""
"如果您通过艺术家查找，并且是通过在列表中单击艺术家的名称而不是选择艺术家名称"
"旁边的单选按钮来选择，则您将不允许将 disc id 附加到发行品。"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:66
msgid "Step 5"
msgstr "步骤 5"

#: ../../usage/retrieve_lookup_cd.rst:68
msgid "If none of the releases displayed are correct, you have the option to add a new release (with some information automatically included)."
msgstr ""
"如果显示的发行品都不正确，您可以选择添加一个新的发行品（其中一些信息将自动包"
"含）。"
